    "detailed_description": "Pretend Cars Racing is an old school top-down racer, featuring split-screen multiplayer, 6 car classes and 30 tracks inspired from real venues.<br><br>Its driving model has the right mix between <strong>arcade and simulation</strong>. You will be having fun in no time but with its high skill ceiling, you will spend hours chasing your best possible lap time.<br><br>Race against <strong>three levels of AI</strong> difficulty, challenge friends via <strong>split-screen or remote play</strong> and chase the top spot in the leaderboards in <strong>hot-lap</strong> mode were you can race against your own ghost.<br><br>Road cars, GTs, prototypes, open-wheelers and overpowered classics bring diversity and challenge to tackle more than <strong>20 international tracks</strong>.<br><br>It runs great in the <strong>Steam Deck</strong>!",
